# Installed into the guest root filesystem. Anything added here changes the
# verity root hash, the command line and every measurement in the reference
# file, so the list stays as short as the guest can run on.

# The renter's session terminates on this sshd, inside the guest, on a host key
# the agent generates at boot and the report commits to.
openssh-server

# The workload image is pulled and run inside the guest against the digest
# HOST_DATA names, so the guest needs its own runtime rather than trusting one
# the host would hand it.
crun
skopeo
umoci

ca-certificates
